== Quest Start ==
Talk to Wizard Schrock in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'Hail, Wizard Schrock'
:''Wizard Schrock says, 'Greetings, Tify.  Do you believe that you are a [great wizard]?' ''
You say, 'great wizard'
:''Wizard Schrock says, 'I will not take your word for it!  You must prove your greatness to be my apprentice.  Which quest do you wish to undertake first? Do you wish to test your [concentration], [focus] or [visualization]? Or perhaps you'd rather work on [meditation], [conception], and [preparation]?' ''

== Wizard Test of Concentration ==

You say, 'concentration'
:''Wizard Schrock says, 'Concentration is of the utmost importance to a wizard.  Without it, we cannot cast even the most simple dweomer.  Proceed upward through the sky, then return to me a grey damask cloak and a wind rune dena.  This will prove your ability to concentrate and I will reward you with an Augmentor's Mask.' ''

'''Reward:''' {{:Augmentor's Mask}}

